<title>USA: Physician says no merit to class action.</title>
<headline>Physician says no merit to class action.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physician Reliance Network Inc said Thursday the class action lawsuit filed against it in Corpus Christi, Texas, and a federal class action lawsuit filed against it in the Northern District of Texas are without merit.</p>
<p>The company said each of these lawsuits apparently asserts that the company's relationships with Texas Oncology P.A. and other affiliated physician groups and related disclosures violate federal and state health care and securities laws.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to vigorously defend itself.</p>
</text>
